---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const updatedDate = '2026-07-11';
const siteUrl = "https://paintprocalculator.com";

// Breadcrumb Schema
const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": siteUrl
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Affiliate Disclosure",
      "item": `${siteUrl}/affiliate-disclosure`
    }
  ]
};

// Article Schema
const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "Affiliate Disclosure - PaintPro Calculator",
  "description": "Affiliate disclosure for PaintPro Calculator. Transparency about how we earn commissions and how that does not affect editorial recommendations.",
  "url": `${siteUrl}/affiliate-disclosure`,
  "datePublished": "2025-12-26",
  "dateModified": updatedDate,
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Zack Pearson",
    "url": `${siteUrl}/about`
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "ProBuild Digital LLC",
    "url": "https://probuilddigital.com"
  },
  "inLanguage": "en-US"
};
---

<Layout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure - Paint Calculator | PaintPro Calculator"
  description="Affiliate disclosure for PaintPro Calculator. Transparency about how we earn commissions and how that does not affect editorial recommendations."
>
  <Header />

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleSchema)} />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-4 pt-8 pb-16 md:pt-14 md:pb-24">
    <article>
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-[2.5rem] md:text-[3.75rem]">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

      <p class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-sm text-muted">
        <span>By <a href="/about" class="link">Zack Pearson</a></span>
        <span>Last updated August 23, 2026</span>
      </p>

      <div class="prose-linen [&>h2]:mt-12 [&>h2]:border-t [&>h2]:border-border [&>h2]:pt-7 md:[&>h2]:mt-14 md:[&>h2]:pt-8">
        <p class="text-[1.1875rem] leading-[1.55]">
          PaintPro Calculator is free to use and runs without a paywall. The site contains affiliate links, and I earn a commission when you buy through one. That commission covers hosting and the time I spend keeping the calculators accurate. It never changes the price you pay.
        </p>

        <h2>What an affiliate link is</h2>
        <p>
          An affiliate link is a tracked URL. When you click one and then make a purchase on the destination site (most often Amazon), I receive a small commission from the retailer. The price you pay is identical to what you would pay going directly. Nothing is added to your cart or your bill.
        </p>

        <h2>Programs I participate in</h2>
        <p>
          PaintPro Calculator is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com. As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases.
        </p>
        <p>
          From time to time the site may also participate in lead-generation partnerships with painting contractors and home-services networks. Those relationships are disclosed within the relevant page or form.
        </p>

        <h2>How affiliate links affect what I recommend</h2>
        <p>
          They don't. If the best paint roller for the job is sold by a brand with no affiliate program, I link to the manufacturer page anyway. If a higher-commission alternative is worse on quality or price, the lower-commission product still wins. The full editorial process is on the <a href="/editorial-standards">editorial standards page</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>My commitments</h2>
        <div class="callout">
          <ul>
            <li>I only recommend products I would buy or have already bought myself.</li>
            <li>Affiliate relationships never change which products I recommend.</li>
            <li>You never pay more by clicking through one of my links.</li>
            <li>The calculator itself contains no affiliate links and is not influenced by any product partnership.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h2>FTC compliance</h2>
        <p>
          This disclosure follows guidance from the U.S. Federal Trade Commission's <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/disclosures-101-social-media-influencers" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Endorsement Guides</a>. Articles that contain affiliate links also include an inline disclosure near the top so it's clear before you click.
        </p>

        <h2>Lead generation partners</h2>
        <p>
          When you request quotes from local painters through forms on this site, the request is sent to a lead-generation partner that matches you with contractors. PaintPro Calculator may receive a referral fee. The service is free to you, you're under no obligation to hire any contractor who responds, and your contact details are handled per the lead-gen partner's privacy policy and our own <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Questions</h2>
        <p>
          If anything on this page is unclear or if you think a specific article isn't disclosing affiliate links properly, email <a href="mailto:zack.pearson@probuilddigital.com">zack.pearson@probuilddigital.com</a> and I'll fix it.
        </p>

        <p class="pt-4 text-sm text-muted">
          Thank you for using the calculator and for supporting the site through these links.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 border-t border-border pt-6">
        <a href="/" class="link">Back to Calculator</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
